      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "只是并排站着，静静等待。\n这样的感觉也很不错，是吧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "537cd547ca1f8c296c5720015df7f0a0c61bfe9cd74a703ae631a45acc470e5b",
