      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "说实话，我也不清楚到底好不好。\n但是好像被什么触动了心弦。\n然后，还有其他更多的感触――",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a5eb2bae1621feeabfedab54b93e18856b8fa1b82716bcc4ae1f1e7e3ba7ed9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
