      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比谁都认真、比谁都温柔，\n这就是她的真面目――",
      "source_fingerprint": "09291a4d606b4a99fbc7b2ee0a6be24df834a9e58c7883c106f67b015eb244c4",
